    "title": "ZenDate - Meet Asian Singles",
    "description": "Find love & romance on ZenDate match app, the place to meet singles and boost your search for single Asian dates. \r\n\r\nInstall the chat app FREE! \r\n\r\nIt is the best online dating app whether you want to date Asian, or simply meet women and men to chat with. \r\nEnjoy truly hassle-free online dating via mobile!\r\n\r\nDownload this great dating app and chat service to increase your interest in Asian men, women and their culture. If you love Asian dating then you will not find a better dating site out there. It is your key to the finest experience in online dating!\r\n\r\nMeet beautiful singles and take online dating to the max! Access these features:\r\n\u2022 Register FREE for online dating with singles from Asia.\r\n\u2022 Quickly add your dating profile with ease.\r\n\u2022 Log in wherever you are to experience online dating for mobile.\r\n\u2022 Browse high-quality dating profiles, photos, and videos of singles.\r\n\u2022 Date through e-mail or live, real-time chat messaging.\r\n\u2022 Get stacks of romantic replies and invites from users ready to date.\r\n\u2022 Maintain a chat contact list with your preferred singles.\r\n\u2022 Experience full safety and security for problem free online dating.\r\n\r\nMeet singles from Asia via one of the world\u2019s finest dating sites, which allows you to enjoy instant messages and a range of other features. If you prefer free online dating then you will miss out on this incredible experience! So get started with the best dating site and make a date with destiny.\r\n\r\nAbout Us\r\nZenDate is at the forefront of the online dating world and offers an unmatched reach. Launched in 1993, our company now covers more than 32 countries and offers the technology that lets members take dating further than ever. The experience we have built since our launch has given us a real insight into what people look for when it comes to dating. \r\n\r\nOur Mission\r\nEverything we do is aimed at bringing singles together and helping them start a relationship with a special person. We have developed this skill into a fine art! Our effective approach helps couples find each other on our website. That is why we continue to be inspired by the love of those who use ZenDate.\r\n\r\nZenDate is the place for singles to find each other and begin a relationship using a range of communication features. We provide the platform and tools for members to get in touch. Like any dating opportunity, it all starts by creating a profile with a photo and sharing personal details. The next step is to search through the membership database and quickly see other people who have joined. One of the highlights of ZenDate is to read about members. Once members are interested in each other, they can talk using a direct message system and Live Chat. All activity takes place on a secure, reliable and safe network that guarantees the privacy and safety of every member. Our Customer Service Team is always on hand to assist with any enquiries.\r\n\r\nMake the ZenDate mobile app and dating site your No.1 destination for love!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Find love &amp; romance on ZenDate match app, the place to meet singles and boost your search for single Asian dates. <br><br>Install the chat app FREE! <br><br>It is the best online dating app whether you want to date Asian, or simply meet women and men to chat with. <br>Enjoy truly hassle-free online dating via mobile!<br><br>Download this great dating app and chat service to increase your interest in Asian men, women and their culture. If you love Asian dating then you will not find a better dating site out there. It is your key to the finest experience in online dating!<br><br>Meet beautiful singles and take online dating to the max! Access these features:<br>\u2022 Register FREE for online dating with singles from Asia.<br>\u2022 Quickly add your dating profile with ease.<br>\u2022 Log in wherever you are to experience online dating for mobile.<br>\u2022 Browse high-quality dating profiles, photos, and videos of singles.<br>\u2022 Date through e-mail or live, real-time chat messaging.<br>\u2022 Get stacks of romantic replies and invites from users ready to date.<br>\u2022 Maintain a chat contact list with your preferred singles.<br>\u2022 Experience full safety and security for problem free online dating.<br><br>Meet singles from Asia via one of the world\u2019s finest dating sites, which allows you to enjoy instant messages and a range of other features. If you prefer free online dating then you will miss out on this incredible experience! So get started with the best dating site and make a date with destiny.<br><br>About Us<br>ZenDate is at the forefront of the online dating world and offers an unmatched reach. Launched in 1993, our company now covers more than 32 countries and offers the technology that lets members take dating further than ever. The experience we have built since our launch has given us a real insight into what people look for when it comes to dating. <br><br>Our Mission<br>Everything we do is aimed at bringing singles together and helping them start a relationship with a special person. We have developed this skill into a fine art! Our effective approach helps couples find each other on our website. That is why we continue to be inspired by the love of those who use ZenDate.<br><br>ZenDate is the place for singles to find each other and begin a relationship using a range of communication features. We provide the platform and tools for members to get in touch. Like any dating opportunity, it all starts by creating a profile with a photo and sharing personal details. The next step is to search through the membership database and quickly see other people who have joined. One of the highlights of ZenDate is to read about members. Once members are interested in each other, they can talk using a direct message system and Live Chat. All activity takes place on a secure, reliable and safe network that guarantees the privacy and safety of every member. Our Customer Service Team is always on hand to assist with any enquiries.<br><br>Make the ZenDate mobile app and dating site your No.1 destination for love!",
